  "id": "mimir-msa",
  "name": "Mimir Labs — Master Services Agreement",
  "formNumber": "ML-MSA",
  "description": "Framework agreement governing Statements of Work for Mimir Labs professional services (Ratatosk, Ragnarok, integration, advisory). Yggdrasil ERP subscriptions are governed by the separate SaaS Subscription Agreement. Source-of-truth markdown: docs/legal/MASTER_SERVICES_AGREEMENT.md.",
  "version": "1.0",
  "sourceType": "composed",
  "createdAt": "2026-04-30T00:00:00",
  "updatedAt": "2026-04-30T00:00:00",
  "author": "Mimir Labs LLC",
  "pageCount": 1,
  "body": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center;\">MIMIR LABS — MASTER SERVICES AGREEMENT</h1><p><b>Agreement No.:</b> <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[MSA Number]</span></p><p><b>Effective Date:</b> <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Effective Date]</span></p><p><b>BETWEEN:</b> Mimir Labs LLC (Harrisburg, Pennsylvania) (\"Provider\")</p><p><b>AND:</b> <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Client Entity]</span> (\"Client\")</p><h2>Article 1 — Definitions</h2><p>\"Statement of Work\" or \"SOW\" means a document executed by both Parties describing specific Services, Deliverables, timeline, and fees. Each SOW is governed by and incorporated into this Agreement.</p><p>\"Services\" means the professional services described in one or more SOWs.</p><p>\"Deliverables\" means work product produced by Provider under a SOW.</p><h2>Article 2 — Services and SOWs</h2><p>Provider shall perform Services described in mutually executed SOWs. Each SOW takes the form set forth in Provider's standard SOW template (see Schedule A) and may be amended only by written instrument signed by both Parties.</p><h2>Article 3 — Yggdrasil ERP Subscriptions Excluded</h2><p>This Agreement does not govern subscriptions to Yggdrasil ERP, which are provided under a separate Software-as-a-Service Subscription Agreement using Provider's published governed-operating-footprint pricing (Annual License = $30,000 + $10,000 × Footprint Score). SOWs executed under this MSA may include Ratatosk, Ragnarok, integration, governance, and advisory services that complement or precede a Yggdrasil deployment.</p><h2>Article 4 — Fees and Payment</h2><p>Client shall pay the fees specified in each SOW. Fees may be structured as fixed-price, time-and-materials, recurring subscription (for non-Yggdrasil services), or milestone-based, as defined in the SOW. Invoices are due within <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Payment Terms]</span> of receipt.</p><p>Ratatosk and Ragnarok fees paid under SOWs executed hereunder are credited 1:1 against any subsequent Yggdrasil ERP Activation fee, subject to the credit terms of the Yggdrasil Subscription Agreement.</p><h2>Article 5 — Term and Termination</h2><p>This Agreement commences on the Effective Date and continues for an initial term of <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Initial Term]</span>, automatically renewing for successive periods of equal length unless either Party provides at least sixty (60) days' written notice of non-renewal.</p><p>Either Party may terminate any SOW for material breach upon thirty (30) days' written notice if the breach is not cured within the notice period.</p><h2>Article 6 — Confidentiality</h2><p>Each Party shall protect the other Party's Confidential Information using reasonable care, not less than the care it uses to protect its own confidential information of like importance. Obligations survive termination for three (3) years.</p><h2>Article 7 — Intellectual Property</h2><p>Provider retains ownership of pre-existing IP, methodologies, and any Deliverables that consist primarily of Provider's pre-existing tooling. Client receives a perpetual, non-exclusive license to Deliverables for Client's internal business purposes. Client retains ownership of Client Data.</p><h2>Article 8 — Limitation of Liability</h2><p>Except for breaches of confidentiality and IP provisions, neither Party's aggregate liability under this Agreement and any SOW shall exceed the total fees paid by Client to Provider under the relevant SOW in the twelve (12) months preceding the claim.</p><h2>Article 9 — Governing Law</h2><p>Governed by the laws of the Commonwealth of Pennsylvania. Disputes shall be resolved in the state or federal courts of Dauphin County, Pennsylvania.</p><h2>Signatures</h2><table style=\"width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"width:50%; vertical-align:top;\"><p><b>PROVIDER — Mimir Labs LLC</b></p><p>Signature: ____________________________</p><p>Name: ____________________________</p><p>Title: ____________________________</p><p>Date: ____________________________</p></td><td style=\"width:50%; vertical-align:top;\"><p><b>CLIENT</b></p><p>Signature: ____________________________</p><p>Name: ____________________________</p><p>Title: ____________________________</p><p>Date: ____________________________</p></td></tr></table>",
